@startuml
title Guided Path – Multi-Step Composition Assistant (Proposed)

actor User as U

participant "GuidedWorkspace" as GW
participant "GuidedDecisionEngine" as GDE
participant "SeedGenerator" as SG
participant "ProgressionGenerationRequest" as PGR
participant "ProgressionAnalysis" as PA
participant "PairingEngine" as PE
participant "Strategy" as STRAT
participant "ChordSuggestionEngine" as CSE
participant "GeneratedProgression" as GP

== Step 1: User chooses musical intention ==
U -> GW : Select intention\n(uplifting, dark, cinematic, etc.)
GW -> GDE : Request contextual guidance

== Step 2: Guided section selection ==
U -> GW : Choose section\n(intro, verse, chorus, bridge)
GW -> GDE : Request section-specific seed options

== Step 3: Guided harmonic role ==
U -> GW : Choose role\n(stable, tense, transitional, resolving)
GW -> SG : Request seed candidates\n(based on intention + section + role)
SG --> GW : Return contextualised seed

== Step 4: Build request ==
GW -> PGR : Build request with chosen seed

== Step 5: Key inference ==
PGR -> PA : Analyse seed\n(determine key, functions,\nstability, tension)
PA --> PGR : Return key-aware analysis

== Step 6: Strategy routing ==
PGR -> PE : Request strategy
PE --> STRAT : Select strategy

== Step 7: Phrase generation ==
loop For each chord
    STRAT -> CSE : suggest(key, lastChord)
    CSE --> STRAT : ranked suggestions
    STRAT -> STRAT : filter + choose chord
end loop

STRAT --> GP : Build GeneratedProgression
GP --> U : Display continuation

== Step 8: Guided next-step decision ==
U -> GW : Choose next section or intention
GW -> GDE : Continue multi-step composition

@enduml
